## Pre-Launch (T-Day morning, before go-live)
- [ ] Final staging test — verify core user flows end-to-end
- [ ] Team standup — all owners confirmed ready
- [ ] Infrastructure scaled and monitoring dashboards live
- [ ] Asset bundle human-read aloud for typos, broken links, wrong screenshots

## Go-Live
- [ ] Deploy to production
- [ ] Verify core flows on production (not staging)
- [ ] Flip feature flags
- [ ] Screenshot / record for retrospective

## Announcement Sequence (human approval required before each post)
- [ ] [HH:MM] Email blast sent — confirm send count
- [ ] [HH:MM] Twitter/X announcement — DRI approved
- [ ] [HH:MM] LinkedIn post — DRI approved
- [ ] [HH:MM] Product Hunt listing live — verify URL
- [ ] [HH:MM] Community posts — DRI approved
- [ ] [HH:MM] Notify partners and press

## Monitor (throughout the day)
- [ ] Server health (error rate < {{ threshold }}%)
- [ ] Signup flow conversion (target: [X] signups by EOD)
- [ ] Support queue length (triage if queue > [N])
- [ ] Social mentions — respond within 30 minutes

## End of Day
- [ ] Metrics snapshot captured
- [ ] Team debrief (15 minutes)
- [ ] Urgent issues documented for tomorrow
- [ ] Retrospective scheduled within 7 days
